design\feature_descriptions\F-8-signed-windows-electron-package-with-bundled-react-app.md:28:- Configure Vite asset paths for packaged loading so JavaScript, CSS, fonts, icons and other assets resolve from the bundled entry point. Direct startup must not produce a blank window or failed `/assets/...` requests.
design\feature_descriptions\F-8-signed-windows-electron-package-with-bundled-react-app.md:34:- Enable mandatory signing for release builds so missing, expired or invalid signing configuration fails the build instead of silently producing unsigned artifacts. Use a trusted timestamp service so the signature remains valid after certificate expiry.
design\feature_descriptions\F-8-signed-windows-electron-package-with-bundled-react-app.md:61:- The application executable and installer have valid Authenticode signatures from the configured application certificate and include a trusted timestamp.
design\feature_descriptions\F_001_github_authentication.md:24:- Register a GitHub OAuth app; its `client_id` ships in the app config. Request scopes needed to read/write repo contents (`repo`, or fine-grained contents read/write).
